No, you had to time it out.
不，你得掌握好时机。

00:33:52.599 --> 00:33:53.599
You had to do it.
你必须得做。

00:33:53.599 --> 00:33:56.299
you were they are standing right next to the camera.
你当时就站在摄像机旁边。

00:33:56.299 --> 00:33:57.140
Yeah, yeah, that's right.
对，对，没错。

00:33:57.140 --> 00:33:58.559
Cause you had to sound that way.
因为你得发出那种声音。

00:33:58.559 --> 00:34:00.160
You were, yeah, you were in there.
你当时在的，对。

00:34:00.160 --> 00:34:01.519
That was really funny to me.
我觉得那真的超级搞笑。

00:34:01.519 --> 00:34:02.359
Yeah.
对。

00:34:02.359 --> 00:34:03.200
So funny.
太搞笑了。

